<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-26T02:57:34.942Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:57:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have escalated attacks on Saudi Arabia, striking two Red Sea ports and a major oil refinery, and hitting a financial district in Riyadh, while Saudi forces intercepted drones and missiles over the Red Sea and western Yemen. The intensified strikes have raised concerns about worsening the humanitarian crisis in Hodeidah port. Iran-backed Houthi rebels claim responsibility for the attacks on the refinery and the financial district. The conflict has caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTFB3a0lzeG9mSVFGcU44R2g0YzBxYjBxbmRpQnNNa2pRQUpIRVAyVWd4VkdUbUM0NmFlRWJHcUtkRnZjajZZb3RJYlhLc0JLbnB6RDFWY3JwZVVjSERKRmlFeFBQb0NoSkdaWWFnVjJlOUZ6WXRycU9iaXpZTkM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTFA0ZzlhZk8tdlVzZHJvcExfX24zS1dteW9XYzdCajlfLVFja0c2czRhWEhWR1RURktJT2hNejUwZmpTSjM1SWEtbEtxdTloZklhZlVvZWItU3RyM0g0SmJaUTVscHRWWEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOaDdOQkIyMWZBYUJGd19raENFUlNZRFhGZ0ctSzRyczJfWFloRVMtRXFlWkR4MVprWV9wS0txVDZfYmJYU2NZR0hhRGV3eTdZZlczSlFmR1VnQko4NGpKa3MzSG5VcENhdGw1cVJHMEdYaTQwVHkxV3I5eUhaUDd1ZHhkWW45elNfRk1XUEdGUTdLWWNqd2tv?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOQ3A0LXhOVDZKQjZyZGIxUlpHN2ZKOVF2S2tmcmpsdkpQQ0VKcVhveHRQRFpIblg5Q3JlN3ptcV9hN3ljWjduTHZ4b05GUHMwVjRZczJuajVfNnVIZl9rMWhPcVVSYlZPLU1lOTVhRVc4V3VPZzZLMUh3YVE4Y3p5TUgyb0RtSTZiU3VGa0E2TVZYOXdlNVQ5QXZFdmF6Qkg0T3pVTkhEaH